graph TD
    %% Environmental Signals and Inputs
    A[Nutrient Limitation] --> B[Environmental Stress Signal]
    C[High Cell Density] --> D[Quorum Sensing Signal]
    E[Surface Contact] --> F[Surface Sensing Signal]
    G[DNA Damage] --> H[SOS Response Signal]
    I[Oxygen Limitation] --> J[Anaerobic Signal]
    
    %% OR Gate 1: Multiple Biofilm Triggers
    B --> K{OR: Any Biofilm<br/>Inducing Signal?}
    D --> K
    F --> K
    H --> K
    J --> K
    K -->|Yes - Signals Present| L[Kinase Phosphorylation Cascade]
    K -->|No - No Signals| M[Maintain Planktonic State]
    
    %% Spo0A Phosphoryl Transfer
    L --> N[KinA/KinB/KinC/KinD Autophosphorylation]
    N --> O[Phosphotransfer to Spo0F]
    O --> P[Spo0F~P Formation]
    P --> Q[Spo0B Phosphotransferase]
    Q --> R[Spo0A Phosphorylation]
    R --> S[Spo0A~P Accumulation]
    
    %% OR Gate 2: Spo0A~P Threshold
    S --> T{OR: Spo0A~P<br/>Above Threshold?}
    T -->|Low - Below Threshold| M
    T -->|High - Above Threshold| U[Biofilm Program Activation]
    
    %% SinR Repression Relief
    U --> V[sinI Gene Transcription]
    V --> W[SinI Protein Production]
    W --> X[SinI Binds SinR]
    X --> Y[/SinR Repressor Inactivated/]
    
    %% AND Gate 1: Matrix Gene Derepression
    Y --> Z["{AND: SinR Inactive<br/>AND Spo0A~P High?"]}
    S --> Z
    Z -->|No| M
    Z -->|Yes| AA[/Matrix Gene Derepression/]
    
    %% OR Gate 3: Which Matrix Operon?
    AA --> AB{OR: Which Matrix<br/>Component?}
    AB -->|EPS Route| AC[epsA-O Operon Transcription]
    AB -->|TasA Route| AD[tasA Operon Transcription]
    AB -->|Both Routes| AE[Both Operons Active]
    
    %% EPS Biosynthesis Pathway
    AC --> AF[EpsA-O Proteins Produced]
    AF --> AG[EpsA Glycosyltransferase]
    AG --> AH[EpsB-E Sugar Synthesis]
    AH --> AI[EpsF-O Export Complex]
    AI --> AJ[Exopolysaccharide Synthesis]
    AJ --> AK[EPS Secreted to Matrix]
    
    %% TasA Amyloid Pathway
    AD --> AL[TasA Protein Synthesis]
    AL --> AM[TapA Anchor Protein]
    AM --> AN[SipW Signal Peptidase]
    AN --> AO[TasA Cleavage and Maturation]
    AO --> AP[TasA Polymerization]
    AP --> AQ[Amyloid Fiber Formation]
    AQ --> AR[Fibers Secreted to Matrix]
    
    %% AND Gate 2: Matrix Assembly
    AK --> AS{AND: EPS Present<br/>AND TasA Present?}
    AR --> AS
    AS -->|No - One Component Only| AT[Weak Matrix]
    AS -->|Yes - Both Present| AU[Strong Matrix Assembly]
    
    %% Motility Repression
    U --> AV[/hag Flagellin Repression/]
    AV --> AW[\Flagella Synthesis Blocked/]
    AW --> AX[Motility Lost]
    
    %% AND Gate 3: Biofilm Commitment
    AU --> AY{AND: Matrix Present<br/>AND Motility Lost?}
    AX --> AY
    AY -->|No| AZ[\Reversible State/]
    AY -->|Yes| BA[Irreversible Biofilm Commitment]
    
    %% Biofilm Maturation
    BA --> BB[Cell-Cell Adhesion]
    BB --> BC[3D Architecture Development]
    BC --> BD[Channels and Towers Formation]
    BD --> BE[Nutrient Gradient Establishment]
    
    %% Heterogeneity and Division of Labor
    BE --> BF{OR: Cell Fate<br/>Decision?}
    BF -->|Matrix Producers| BG[High EPS/TasA Expression]
    BF -->|Sporulation| BH[Spo0A Very High - Sporulation]
    BF -->|Surfactin Producers| BI[Surfactin Synthesis]
    
    %% Final Outputs
    BG --> BJ[Mature Biofilm Structure]
    BH --> BJ
    BI --> BJ
    BJ --> BK([Biofilm Established])
    M --> BL([Planktonic Growth])
    
